# the lesson map as it was drawn: a working file, not a source the site reads
#
# The picture that matters is public/maps/<page>.json - coordinates, curves
# and all - and the site reads only that. The HTML it was drawn in is where
# the next version gets drawn; keeping both in the repository means two
# places to change and one of them silently wrong.
content/js-classes-mindmap*.html
